    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: And much less like a box.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Ukrainian
    Text: "\u0406 \u0437\u043D\u0430\u0447\u043D\u043E \u043C\u0435\u043D\u0448\u0435
      \u0441\u0445\u043E\u0436\u0435 \u043D\u0430 \u043A\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043A\u0443."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Y mucho menos como una caja.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
