    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: But today, we just get to know the base.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Ukrainian
    Text: "\u0410\u043B\u0435 \u0441\u044C\u043E\u0433\u043E\u0434\u043D\u0456 \u043C\u0438
